HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,i],flag=array[*,3,i].  The zeroth image           HISTORY (array[*,*,0]) contains the data for the aperture in the order          HISTORY closest to the bottom of the detector that is closest to the            HISTORY bottom of the slit (i.e. also closest to the bottom of the              HISTORY detector).  Moving up the detector, the FITS array is filled in         HISTORY with subsequent extraction apertures.  If no orders have been           HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0473.fits, spectra0474.fits,          HISTORY spectra0475.fits, spectra0476.fits, spectra0477.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0478.fits, spectra0479.fits, spectra0480.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0481.fits, spectra0482.fits, spectra0483.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0484.fits, spectra0485.fits, spectra0486.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0487.fits, spectra0488.fits, spectra0505.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0506.fits, spectra0507.fits, spectra0508.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0509.fits, spectra0510.fits, spectra0511.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0512.fits, spectra0513.fits, spectra0514.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0515.fits, spectra0516.fits, spectra0517.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0518.fits, spectra0519.fits, spectra0520.fits were               HISTORY combined using a robust weighted mean with a sigma threshold of         